sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Client
  participant API as Express API
  participant Redis
  participant Worker
  participant DB as MongoDB
  Client->>API: Send operation and optional messageId
  API->>DB: Read actor and prior message result
  API->>Redis: Resolve live owner and generation
  API->>Worker: HTTP POST to actor message endpoint
  Worker->>Worker: Serialize by actor ID in local queue
  Worker->>Redis: Validate owner and generation
  Worker->>DB: Load actor and processed ID history
  Worker->>Worker: Apply actor operation
  Worker->>DB: Conditional state/version update
  Worker->>DB: Attempt separate message record insert
  Worker-->>API: Result and actor
  API-->>Client: JSON response
